message: "If you use this software, cite it and the SimPT-Power data release (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23067065)."
title: "PortugueseOPD: build, validation and release code for SimPT-Power, a public-data multi-voltage (0.4-400 kV) simulation database of mainland Portugal"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhou"
    given-names: "Minglei"
    affiliation: "University of Minho"
version: "simpt-power-2026.09.30-r3"
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MingLeiZhou/PortugueseOPD"
keywords:
  - power systems
  - power flow
  - distribution network
  - open data
  - Portugal
  - pandapower
abstract: >-
  Acquisition, network-building, power-flow, validation and release code for
  SimPT-Power: the 60-400 kV core CORE-3787-REN with 31,492 solved 15-minute
  AC power-flow snapshots, medium-voltage root slices, secondary substations,
  four-wire and geographic low-voltage networks, and the frozen and public
  release tooling, plus example notebooks.
